  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/f17fe402f98bb01e6c434026861e42229a2db5fdddb9ac339c012f7a2b73afa8.png] \n\n1. × and −\n\n__**192 ÷ 16**__ + 8 - __**25 × 95**__ = 26 \n\n⇒ __**12 + 8**__ - 2375 = 26\n\n⇒ __**20 - 2375**__ = 26 \n\n⇒ -2355 ≠ 26 \n\n2. − and ÷\n\n192 - 16 + 8 × __**25 ÷ 95**__ = 26 \n\n⇒ 192 - 16 + __**8 × 0.26 **__= 26 \n\n⇒ __**192**__ - 16 __**+ 2.08**__ = 26 \n\n⇒ __**194.08 - 16**__ = 26 \n\n⇒ 178.08 ≠ 26 \n\n3. + and ×\n\n__**192 ÷ 16**__ × 8 + 25 − 95 = 26 \n\n⇒ __**12 ×**____** 8**__ + 25 − 95 = 26 \n\n⇒ __**96**____** + 25**__ − 95 = 26 \n\n⇒ __**121**____** − 95**__ = 26 \n\n⇒ 26 = 26 \n\n4. ÷ and +\n\n192 + __**16 ÷ 8**__ × 25 − 95 = 26 \n\n⇒ 192 + __**2**____** × 25**__ − 95 = 26 \n\n⇒ __**192 +**____** **__**__50__** − 95 = 26\n\n⇒ __**242 - 95**__ = 26\n\n⇒147 ≠ 26\n\nHence, '**+ and ×**' is the correct answer.",
